r, \\\"Visited Aug 20, 2026\\\", the comment and 4 filled / 1 muted stars. Review stored with restaurantId \\\"5\\\" only and does not appear on other restaurants.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied WELCOME10 → toast \\\"Coupon Applied! 10% off your first reservation\\\" and badge \\\"WEEKEND20/WELCOME10 - 10% off\\\"; X button removed the coupon and restored the code input; after booking, reservation card shows \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\" and localStorage record has couponCode: WELCOME10.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Date picker (August 2026, today = Aug 27, 2026): all cells up to and including Aug 27 are disabled; Aug 28 onward selectable. Selected Aug 31, 2026 → trigger shows \\\"Aug 31, 2026\\\" and time list (17:00–21:00) allowed selecting 19:00.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reservation date cannot be changed — modify dialog offers no date control\", \"actual\": \"\\\"Modify Reservation\\\" dialog for the upcoming Golden Fork booking contains only \\\"New Time\\\" and \\\"Party Size\\\" selects plus Save Changes/Close; there is no date picker or any way to change the reservation date. Time (19:00→20:30) and party size (2→4 Guests) saved correctly and the list updated, but the date remained August 31, 2026 with no option to modify it.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No reservation-based gating on reviews\", \"actual\": \"On Spice Route (/restaurant/5), for which the user has never made any reservation (only reservation ever created was for The Golden Fork, later cancelled), the \\\"Write a Review\\\" tab is fully enabled and the review submitted successfully (\\\"Review Submitted!\\\" toast, review persisted and shown as Reviews (1)). There is no check for a completed reservation and no per-reservation one-review limit anywhere in the UI.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Coupon day-eligibility rule not enforced: weekend-only coupon accepted on a weekday\", \"actual\": \"With date = Mon Aug 31, 2026 and party size 2 on The Golden Fork, applying WEEKEND20 succeeded: badge \\\"WEEKEND20 - 20% off\\\" and toast \\\"Coupon Applied! 20% off weekend dining\\\", despite Aug 31, 2026 being a Monday. (Party-size rule works: GROUP15 with 2 guests was rejected with \\\"This coupon requires a party of 6 or more.\\\"; only one coupon can be held at a time since the input is replaced by the applied-coupon badge.)\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Trattoria Bella form: valid name/email/phone but no date/time → toast \\\"Missing Information: Please fill in all required fields.\\\" and no reservation stored. Empty name → native form validation blocks submit and reports on the field \\\"Please fill out this field.\\\"; email \\\"not-an-email\\\" → submit blocked with \\\"Please include an '@' in the email address.\\\" (inputs are required, type=email/tel, button type=submit). No reservation was created in any invalid case.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"Modify\\\" opens a Modify Reservation dialog (time + party size) whose Save Changes applied 19:00→20:30 and 2→4 Guests with toast \\\"Reservation Updated\\\". \\\"Cancel\\\" opens an alertdialog \\\"Cancel Reservation? This action cannot be undone…\\\" with Keep Reservation / Cancel Reservation; choosing Keep Reservation left the booking intact (still Upcoming (1), status confirmed).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create → inline \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\" panel; Modify → toast \\\"Reservation Updated\\\" and card immediately showing 20:30 / 4 Guests; Cancel → toast \\\"Reservation Cancelled\\\" and tabs instantly re-counting Upcoming (0) / Past (1). All updates rendered in-session with no manual reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/reservations has \\\"Upcoming (n)\\\" and \\\"Past (n)\\\" tabs; upcoming card showed status badge \\\"Upcoming\\\" with restaurant name+cuisine/price, August 31 2026, 20:30, 4 Guests, Downtown, \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\"; after cancelling, the same card appears under Past with badge \\\"Cancelled\\\" and identical detail fields.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Ratings inconsistent between list and detail; list summary not derived from reviews and never updates\", \"actual\": \"Restaurant list shows static ratings with no review count (The Golden Fork 4.8, Spice Route 4.4), while detail pages compute from reviews (The Golden Fork 4.5 (2); Spice Route 4.0 (1) after my 4-star review). After submitting the Spice Route review, the detail header/Reviews tab updated to 4.0 (1) but the list card still shows 4.4 — the two views disagree.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
